              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Soup Loving Nicole"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Loved these! I was not able to find 2.5 ounce bags of corn chips so I used the individual lunch size bags that are half the amount. Because of that, I was able to make 8 tacos instead of 4. Score! I used Fritos as the recipe called for but Doritos would be good too. These are fun and would be great to serve for a kids birthday party.",
